   Grothendieck/AlgebraicGeometry/Folder126NilpotentDescent.lean are adapted from the proof of
   Module.Descent.exists_fin_invariant_span_ideal and the private lemma mem_of_map_eq of
   StacksFrontier/RingTheory/Descent/CechSquareZeroGenerators.lean at that commit; and, in
   Grothendieck/AlgebraicGeometry/Folder126NilpotentFlat.lean, the proofs of
   exists_isBaseChange_of_comparison,
